  "changes": [
    "AI source is preserved completely and partitioned automatically into non-overlapping exact, regex and context views; the independent complete runtime provider is retired.",
    "Native overseas AI brand categories provide bounded fallback; broader AI category follows domestic IP direct handling.",
    "Google IP fallback and corresponding UDP rejection preserve earlier dedicated AI, Telegram and Netflix IP rules.",
    "Unused old complete AI providers are removed during script upgrade; DNS and sub-rule dependencies remain intact.",
    "2.2 is the primary root entry; compatibility entries are generated identically; six historical versions are archived byte-for-byte.",
